description:
The Government intends to solicit from Small Business sources the ability to pick up, transport, and offload vehicles and equipment using a flatbed trailer configuration.&nbsp; The pickups will be at Arlington National Cemetery and the dropoffs&nbsp; / Unloads will be at the Defense Logistics Agency (DLA) Center located at Defense Supply Center Richmond, 6090 Strathmore Road, Bldg. 60C or Bldg 6C, Richmond, Virginia 23237.&nbsp;&nbsp; 

The typical trip is +/- 125 miles each way from Arlington National Cemetery (ANC) the Center.&nbsp; The responding entities shall be insured and maintain both Department of Transportation certifications as well as any state and local vehicular requirements. 

At this time this posting is not a formal solicitation nor does a respone by one of more entities constitute a competitive determination of such. 

Please provide a capability statement and a fully burdened hourly rate or rate per mile as an alternative as a rough order of magnitude and not an offical pricing proposal.&nbsp; No phone calls will be accepted.&nbsp; Please submit Request for Information not later than 11/23/2026 12:00PM Eastern Standard Time.&nbsp; RFI submitted after that will not be honored. 

Before responding to this Sources Sought Notice please keep in mind that the Limitations of Subcontracting require the entity to perform 51% or more of the actual work.&nbsp; With this being said, subcontracting opportunities do not exist and non-towing / hauling companies or expiditers and brokers need not respond.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;
